Sun Aug 30 13:31:00 UTC 2026 - Wozaaard! <cin.sourcer@gmail.com>

- Initial package version 0.1.0.
- Run named AmneziaWG profiles in isolated systemd-nspawn containers.
- Expose per-profile SOCKS5 and HTTP proxies with nftables networking.
- Provide D-Bus/Polkit management, CLI and a separate GNOME application.
- Support AWG 3.1 configuration parameters and passwordless delegation to
  members of the amnezia group.
